SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Kamariani\, Mikro Chorio
LOCATION:Mikro Chorio\, Tilos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The ghost village of Mikro Chorio\, abandoned in the 1960s\, fills again on 23 August for the feast of Panagia Kamariani\, with music\, dance and free food among the ruins. Same night as Politissa in Livadia\, ten minutes away\, so pick one.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/tilos/#mikro-chorio-panigiri-of-panagia-kamariani-mikro-chorio
